0 -14 Td
(are separate measures. A connection should be counted as functional only when it delivers) Tj
0 -14 Td
(the prescribed service level at the point of use; a one-time installation record is not) Tj
0 -14 Td
(evidence of sustained service. Water-quality monitoring should record the sample source,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(collection date, parameter tested and the action taken when a result is unsafe.) Tj
